    "rendering": "high-definition-stylized-raster",
    "effectLanguage": "A restrained white-grey tyre-smoke effect that begins at the rear wheel contact patches, stretches behind the moving car, separates into soft wisps and low haze, and remains readable without becoming an opaque screen-filling wall.",
